Now, another subtlety: The order says "en T04 al menos 10 de cada uno en un bloque que además contiene transacciones válidas (para demostrar que invalida el bloque entero)". This means a directed test where a block has valid non-evidence txs plus a defective evidence, and the whole block is invalid. Need to ensure that "the block contains valid txs" — e.g., transfer/deposit that would otherwise apply.

Also "≥ 5 con los dos defectos a la vez (gana cbid, por la precedencia)". So blocks with an evidence that has both alien cbid and non-canonical order must report CbidAjeno motive, not order.

